<Page title="Project and website terms." description="ArtemisKit is an open-source project by Vorbtech Innovative Solutions. The toolkit is licensed under Apache-2.0 as recorded in the core repository. Website information explains the project and its capabilities; assessment work requires a separately agreed scope, authorised access and commercial terms." eyebrow="Project information"><h2>Open-source software</h2><p>The authoritative software terms are the <a href="https://github.com/code-sensei/artemiskit/blob/main/LICENSE">Apache-2.0 licence in the core repository</a>. Fonts, third-party assets and trademarks retain their applicable terms. Downloading a logo does not transfer ownership of the brand.</p><h2>Testing and interpretation</h2><p>Test only systems and data you are authorised to use. Apply appropriate access, privacy and safety controls. A finding is limited to the declared scenario, configuration and available evidence; it does not guarantee safety or certify regulatory compliance.</p><h2>Assessment enquiries</h2><p>An assessment request or enquiry does not create an engagement or authorise testing. Scope, access, confidentiality, data handling, timing and fees must be agreed separately.</p><h2>Versions and planned work</h2><p>Capabilities can vary by package version. Use the relevant release records and source-backed documentation. Planned features, a future leaderboard and separate products are not delivered services merely because they appear in a roadmap.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Use the contact details published on the <a href="https://www.vorbtech.com.ng/">official Vorbtech website</a>. Prepared 24 October 2026.</p></Page>
